Subject: [PATCH] Identify the Sairedis registry module by its merged source

Sairedis declares version 0.0.2 in its source tree. Append the full merged
source commit so Bazel resolves this registration to the reviewed archive.
This registry-only patch changes the module version, not the build rules.

Source: https://github.com/securely1g/sonic-sairedis/commit/54233eede3bb2eb319f6041bc8329586483012d0

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 # Keep bazel_compatibility in sync with sonic-buildimage's .bazelversion.
 module(
     name = "sonic-sairedis",
-    version = "0.0.2",
+    version = "0.0.2-54233eede3bb2eb319f6041bc8329586483012d0",
     bazel_compatibility = [
         ">=8.5.1",
         "<=8.5.1",
